<overview>
<p>Capellan infantry forces field the Assuan, a small off-road bike fitted with Luxor mobile artillery batteries. Its armored shell was made not so much to protect the rider as the extremely valuable light TAG mounted in a spherical casing on the front. The Assuan is a successful spotter, presenting a very small target that can reach places inaccessible to larger vehicles.</p>
</overview>

